iple frames (e.g., Frames 1, 3, 6, 11, 16, 18, 21, 25).\n\nShe is clearly the second speaker in this sequence, as she is the other primary presenter sharing the stage with Pat Gelsinger.\n\n---\n\n**Step 2: Check if a second speaker is clearly visible on stage**\n\n✅ Yes. The woman in the light purple suit is clearly visible on stage in nearly all frames, especially from Frame 3 onward, where she is standing next to Pat Gelsinger.\n\n---\n\n**Step 3: Check if there is a clear view of her face and upper body**\n\n✅ Yes. In frames such as 1, 6, 11, 16, 18, 21, 25, and 27, her face and upper body are clearly visible, often in medium or medium close-up shots.\n\n---\n\n**Step 4: Check if a microphone is visibly attached to or held by this speaker**\n\n✅ Yes. In multiple frames (e.g., Frame 6, 11, 15, 18, 21, 22, 25), the woman is holding a small, black handheld microphone in her right hand. It is clearly visible in her grip as she gestures and speaks.\n\nExample:\n- **Frame 21**: She holds the microphone in her right hand, close to her mouth, while gesturing with her left.\n- **Frame 18**: The microphone is visible in her right hand, held near her chest.\n- **Frame 6**: She holds the mic in her right hand while gesturing with her left.\n\n---\n\n**Step 5: Check if the microphone placement is specifically visible (left/right face, in hand, on collar)**\n\n✅ Yes. The microphone is consistently shown **in her right hand**. It is not clipped to her collar or lapel, nor is it positioned on either side of her face. It is clearly handheld.\n\n---\n\n**Step 6: Check for obstructions**\n\n✅ No obstructions. The view of her upper body and hand holding the microphone is unobstructed in all relevant frames.\n\n---\n\n**Conclusion:**\n\nThe microphone of the second speaker (the woman in the light purple suit) is **clearly and consistently held in her hand**, specifically her right hand, across multiple frames.\n\nTherefore, the answer **\'3\' ("In the hand") is correct**.\n\n✅ **Verified: The microphone is in the hand of the second speaker.**'}, {'batch_start': 30, 'batch_end': 60, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1625.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1626.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1627.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1628.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1629.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1630.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1631.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1632.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1633.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1634.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1635.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1636.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1637.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1638.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1639.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1640.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1641.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1642.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1643.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1644.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1645.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1646.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1647.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames/frame_1648.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/QB7FoIpx8os/frames